return ['domain'=>'wpml-import','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'WPML Export and Import 5.0.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-15T17:43:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['WPML Export and Import'=>'WPML Export and Import','https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/wpml-export-and-import/'=>'https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/wpml-export-and-import/','A multipurpose plugin to export and import multilingual content.'=>'一個用於匯出與匯入多語系內容的多功能外掛。','OnTheGoSystems'=>'OnTheGoSystems','http://www.onthegosystems.com'=>'http://www.onthegosystems.com','The import trigger no longer accepts the key in the URL. Send it in a POST body.'=>'匯入觸發器不再接受 URL 中的金鑰。請在 POST 主體中傳送。','Method Not Allowed'=>'不允許此方法','Unauthorized'=>'未經授權','No items to process'=>'沒有可處理的項目','No Content'=>'無內容','Import process completed'=>'匯入程序已完成','Success'=>'成功','Import process failed'=>'匯入程序失敗','Internal Server Error'=>'內部伺服器錯誤','%1$s: %2$d item could not be processed and was skipped.'=>'%1$s：%2$d 個項目無法處理並已跳過。','Cleaning Up Post Data'=>'正在清理文章資料','Removing temporary and import-related post meta data.'=>'正在移除暫存與匯入相關的文章中繼資料。','Cleaning Up Term Data'=>'正在清理項目資料','Removing temporary and import-related term meta data.'=>'正在移除暫存與匯入相關的項目中繼資料。','Connecting Post Image Attachments'=>'正在連結文章圖片附件','Updating thumbnail and gallery attachment IDs on translated posts, products, and CPTs to point to their translated equivalents.'=>'正在更新已翻譯文章、商品和 CPT 上的縮圖與組圖附件 ID，以指向其對應的翻譯項目。','Connecting Inline Term Translations'=>'正在連結行內項目翻譯','Scanning posts with a single taxonomy term in order to identify and connect the terms assigned to these posts with their translations.'=>'正在掃描僅包含單一分類法項目的文章，以便識別這些文章所分配的項目並與其翻譯進行連結。','Deleting Obsolete Original Terms'=>'正在刪除過時的原始項目','Removing original terms that are no longer needed after creating duplicates for same-named terms. Ensuring no posts are linked to these original terms.'=>'正在移除為同名項目建立副本後不再需要的原始項目。確保沒有文章連結到這些原始項目。','Duplicating Terms with Shared Names Across Languages'=>'正在跨語言複製具有相同名稱的項目','Creating duplicates in the correct language for terms that share the same name across languages, but belong to posts in different languages.'=>'為跨語言共用相同名稱但屬於不同語言文章的項目，在正確的語言中建立副本。','Fixing Imported Post Slugs'=>'正在修正匯入的文章代稱','Regenerating translated post slugs to prevent conflicts with the originals.'=>'正在重新產生已翻譯的文章代稱，以防止與原始項目發生衝突。','Clearing Translations Cache'=>'正在清除翻譯快取','Invalidating the persistent cache so it can be regenerated.'=>'使永久快取失效以便重新產生。','Marking Parent Terms for Connection'=>'正在標記父級項目以進行連結','Collecting parent terms to connect their translations in the next step.'=>'正在收集父級項目，以便在下一步中連結其翻譯。','Connecting Posts with Correct Term Translations'=>'正在將文章與正確的項目翻譯連結','Ensuring posts are connected to terms in the correct language, especially if you have the same term names across languages.'=>'確保文章連結到正確語言的項目，特別是當您在不同語言中擁有相同的項目名稱時。','Sending Posts for Automatic Translation'=>'正在將文章傳送至自動翻譯','Creating automatic translation jobs for posts flagged for auto-translation in the exported data.'=>'正在為匯出資料中標記為自動翻譯的文章建立自動翻譯工作。','Setting Attachments\' Language'=>'正在設定附件語言','Assigning a language to imported attachments.'=>'正在為匯入的附件分配語言。','Updating Final Post Status'=>'正在更新最終文章狀態','Setting the post status based on the "_wpml_import_after_process_post_status" field from the import file (if provided).'=>'根據匯入檔案中的「_wpml_import_after_process_post_status」欄位（如果有提供）設定文章狀態。','Identifying Inline Term Languages'=>'正在識別行內項目語言','Identifying and setting the language of terms created during post imports.'=>'正在識別並設定文章匯入期間建立的項目語言。','Setting Posts’ Language'=>'正在設定文章語言','Connecting posts to the default language and translations.'=>'正在將文章連結到預設語言和翻譯。','Setting Terms’ Language'=>'正在設定項目語言','Connecting taxonomy terms to the default (original) language and translations.'=>'正在將分類法項目連結到預設（原始）語言和翻譯。','Setting Parent Terms\' Language'=>'正在設定父級項目語言','Assigning language to parent taxonomy terms that don\'t have one, based on the language assigned to their children.'=>'根據子項目分配的語言，為尚未分配語言的父級分類法項目分配語言。','Migrating your multilingual site? Remember to also install %s on your new site before importing your content so we can restore all the translations.'=>'正在遷移您的多語系網站嗎？請記得在匯入內容之前，先在您的新網站上安裝 %s，以便我們還原所有翻譯。','Migrating your multilingual shop? With %1$s and %2$s you can transfer your translated content to a new site, including cross-sells, up-sells, and product attributes.'=>'正在遷移您的多語系商店嗎？透過 %1$s 與 %2$s，您可以將翻譯內容轉移到新網站，包括交叉銷售、向上銷售和商品屬性。','Migrating your multilingual shop? Remember to install %1$s and %2$s on your new site before importing your content so we can restore all the translations.'=>'正在遷移您的多語系商店嗎？請記得在匯入內容之前，先在您的新網站上安裝 %1$s 與 %2$s，以便我們還原所有翻譯。','Looking to import your multilingual content? Remember to install %s in your original site before exporting its content so we can import all the translations here.'=>'想要匯入您的多語系內容嗎？請記得在匯出內容之前，先在您的原始網站安裝 %s，以便我們可以在此匯入所有翻譯。','Looking to import your multilingual content? Install %1$s on this site.'=>'想要匯入您的多語系內容嗎？請在此網站安裝 %1$s。','Remember to also enable %2$s and %3$s in your original shop before exporting its content so we can import all the translations here.'=>'請記得在匯出內容之前，也要在您的原始商店中啟用 %2$s 與 %3$s，以便我們可以在此匯入所有翻譯。','Looking to import your multilingual content? Remember to enable %1$s and %2$s in your original shop before exporting its content so we can import all the translations here.'=>'想要匯入您的多語系內容嗎？請記得在匯出內容之前，先在您的原始商店中啟用 %1$s 與 %2$s，以便我們可以在此匯入所有翻譯。','WooCommerce Multilingual'=>'WooCommerce Multilingual','Switch to all languages'=>'切換到所有語言','Linking Product Attribute Translations'=>'正在連結商品屬性翻譯','Connecting product attributes to their translations based on associated product variations.'=>'根據關聯的商品選項將商品屬性連結到其翻譯。','Updating Related Products On Translations'=>'正在更新翻譯上的相關商品','Setting up-sells, cross-sells and grouped products references in the right language.'=>'在正確的語言中設定向上銷售、交叉銷售和分組商品引用。','Importing Custom Attribute Labels'=>'正在匯入自訂屬性標籤','Importing labels for product-specific (custom) attributes from the exported data.'=>'正在從匯出資料中匯入商品特定（自訂）屬性的標籤。','You are about to export all your products in all languages at once.'=>'您即將一次匯出所有語言的所有商品。','Remember to install %1$s and %2$s on your new site before importing your content so we can restore all the translations.'=>'請記得在匯入內容之前，先在您的新網站上安裝 %1$s 與 %2$s，以便我們還原所有翻譯。','You are about to export your products in %s.'=>'您即將匯出 %s 中的商品。','Registering Product Attributes'=>'正在註冊商品屬性','Identifying and registering attributes created during product imports for translation.'=>'正在識別並註冊商品匯入期間建立的屬性以進行翻譯。','Identifying Product Attribute Languages'=>'正在識別商品屬性語言','Identifying and setting the language of attributes created during product imports.'=>'正在識別並設定商品匯入期間建立的屬性語言。','Export and Import'=>'匯出與匯入','I’m using the built-in %s export/import tool'=>'我正在使用內建的 %s 匯出/匯入工具','I’m using %s plugin'=>'我正在使用 %s 外掛','(%1$d/%2$d items)'=>'(%1$d/%2$d 個項目)','%d skipped'=>'已跳過 %d 個','(no items)'=>'(無項目)','Counting items...'=>'正在計算項目...','First, tell us how you’re going to create the content that you’ll be importing:'=>'首先，請告訴我們您將如何建立要匯入的內容：','Continue'=>'繼續','I’m using %1$s and %2$s plugins'=>'我正在使用 %1$s 與 %2$s 外掛','I’m using a different method to export from this site'=>'我正在使用不同的方法從此網站匯出','I’m exporting the content from this site'=>'我正在從此網站匯出內容','I’m exporting the content from a different website or system'=>'我正在從不同的網站或系統匯出內容','Before importing, add language columns to your content'=>'在匯入之前，請為您的內容新增語言欄位','Make sure that your import file includes the following columns (custom fields) with language information:'=>'請確保您的匯入檔案包含以下帶有語言資訊的欄位 (自訂欄位)：','%s: A value that’s the same for all the translations of each item. In e-commerce sites this will often be the SKU.'=>'%s：每個項目及其所有翻譯都相同的數值。在電子商務網站中，這通常是 SKU。','%s: The language code for each item.'=>'%s：每個項目的語言代碼。','And, you can include these two columns if needed:'=>'此外，如果需要，您可以包含這兩個欄位：','%s: If this item is a translation, set this column to the code of the source language. If it’s not a translation, keep it empty.'=>'%s：如果此項目是翻譯，請將此欄位設定為原文語言的代碼。如果不是翻譯，請保持空白。','%s: Set to “draft” or “published” to determine the publishing status of the post after adjusting languages. Usually, this value will be “published”.'=>'%s：設定為「draft」(草稿) 或「published」(已發佈)，以決定調整語言後文章的發佈狀態。通常，此值為「published」。','Here is an example of importing two items, into your site’s languages (%s):'=>'這是一個將兩個項目匯入到您網站語言 (%s) 的範例：','Once you’ve added language columns to your multilingual content file, import it to your site using whatever import plugin you prefer.'=>'在多語系內容檔案中新增語言欄位後，使用您偏好的任何匯入外掛將其匯入到您的網站。','Before importing, your content needs language information'=>'在匯入之前，您的內容需要語言資訊','%s will add the necessary language information to your export.'=>'%s 將為您的匯出內容新增必要的語言資訊。','Import your multilingual content file into the site using whatever import plugin you prefer.'=>'使用您偏好的任何匯入外掛將多語系內容檔案匯入到網站中。','Use your favorite import plugin'=>'使用您喜愛的匯入外掛','After you import the content, it will still not show the correct language information. So, we recommend that you import new content as Drafts. If you’re importing updates, you can keep already-published content as published.'=>'匯入內容後，它仍不會顯示正確的語言資訊。因此，我們建議您將新內容匯入為草稿。如果您正在匯入更新，可以將已發佈的內容保持為已發佈。','Return here, to %s, to set languages and connect translations'=>'返回此處的 %s 以設定語言並連結翻譯','When you visit this page after you’ve imported content with language information, you’ll be able to run %s to apply languages and connect translations.'=>'當您在匯入帶有語言資訊的內容後造訪此頁面時，您將能夠執行 %s 來套用語言並連結翻譯。','Already imported and still seeing this screen? %1$sTroubleshooting %2$s%3$s.'=>'已經匯入但仍看到此畫面？%1$s疑難排解 %2$s%3$s。','How to Export and Import Content in Multiple Languages'=>'如何匯出與匯入多種語言的內容','%s is ready to update your imported content'=>'%s 已準備好更新您匯入的內容','Good job. We see %1$d terms and %2$d posts that are imported and need language information.'=>'做得好。我們發現有 %1$d 個項目和 %2$d 篇文章已匯入且需要語言資訊。','Good job. We see %d terms that are imported and need language information.'=>'做得好。我們發現有 %d 個項目已匯入且需要語言資訊。','Good job. We see %d posts that are imported and need language information.'=>'做得好。我們發現有 %d 篇文章已匯入且需要語言資訊。','Run WPML Import'=>'執行 WPML Import','Multilingual Import Complete'=>'多語系匯入完成']];